{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1gpbvp","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello, I’m Charith Kalhara. I’m a Computer Science student at IIT Sri Lanka, affiliated with the University of Westminster. I’m building my professional identity around software development and cloud engineering. I enjoy creating practical applications and understanding what it takes to deploy them reliably. That is the simple idea behind my personal brand: I build useful software and work to make it dependable in the cloud.\n\nIn this short introduction, I’ll share the technical areas I’m developing, one project that brings them together, and the direction I want to take next.\n\nSource: https://lk.linkedin.com/in/charithkalhara"}
